AGENDA ITEMS
6.
ORDINANCE _2d READING
— Amending various sections of Chapter 15.08, 15.09,
15.10. 15.12, 15.16, 15.22, 15.24 and 15.26 ofTitle 15, Buildings and Construction. ofthe
Municipal Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, updating specified Building Code
requirements and making technical corrections as further specified. (SPONSOR
— MR.
SEGRAVE)
Dr. Aldrich moved to approve on 2” reading, seconded by Mr. White.
Motion carried by
unanimous voice vote.
Antony Pomerleau, Chief Building Official, provided a staff report. John Brodie, City Attorney
and Tom Cobb, City Engineer, provided additional infonnation. Committee members Aldrich,
Emmons, and White commented on the item. Public comment was made by Michael White.
7,
ORDINANCE
2d READING
— Amending various sections within Chapter 8.12,
International Fire Code adopted, of Title 8, Health and Safety, of the Municipal Code of
the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, updating the edition of the International Fire Code
adopted by the City and further amending as specified. (SPONSOR— MR. SEGRAVE)
Mr. White moved to approve on 2 reading. seconded by Dr. Emmons. Motion carried with Dr.
Emmons and Mr. White voting “YES” and Dr. Aldrich voting “NO.”
Bob Mason, Fire Marshal, Fire Rescue Department, provided a staff report. Committee members
Aldrich. Emmons, and White commented on the item. Public comments were made by Travis
Spears, The Electric & Solar Specialist, and Michael White.
8.
